<BlogPost
  title="What Is Territory Running? The Game Turning Cities Into Turf"
  description="Territory running is the running game where the area you enclose by running a loop becomes yours — and rivals can steal it. Here’s how it works and why it’s so addictive."
  path="/blog/what-is-territory-running"
